------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vendored code
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The benchmark scorer at eval/score.py is Qvest.US code vendored (frozen, byte-identical)
from the original benchmark harness so numbers stay comparable
across environments. It is developer tooling and is not part of the installed package.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
External programs
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The CLI optionally invokes FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org), if present on the
system PATH, to re-encode output to H.264. FFmpeg is a separate program under
its own license (LGPL/GPL). The source tree does not vendor FFmpeg.

The published Docker image (`Dockerfile`) installs the Debian `ffmpeg` package
into the container. Anyone who redistributes that image must comply with
FFmpeg's license (and Debian's packaging notices) in addition to this project's
Apache-2.0 terms.
